{% comment %}
  Local override of al_folio_core's selected_papers.liquid.

  The gem's version passes `--group_by none`, which renders the selected papers
  in bibliography file order with no year headings. Dropping it makes the
  homepage honour scholar.group_by / scholar.group_order from _config.yml
  (year, descending), so the list is grouped under year headings in reverse
  chronological order, matching the publications page.
{% endcomment %}
<div class="publications">
  {% bibliography --query @*[selected=true]* %}
</div>
